	"transcription": [
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:00,000",
				"to": "00:00:03,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 3360
			},
			"text": "三哥我想继续往下 接下来"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:03,360",
				"to": "00:00:05,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 3360,
				"to": 5600
			},
			"text": "就是对 下一个问题就说"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:05,600",
				"to": "00:00:10,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 5600,
				"to": 10120
			},
			"text": "当真正有钱之后有什么东西是您发现钱解决不了的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:11,160",
				"to": "00:00:13,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 11160,
				"to": 13880
			},
			"text": "企业还是咱们俩讲讲讲的 就是我觉得政治"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:15,080",
				"to": "00:00:17,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 15080,
				"to": 17640
			},
			"text": "认知真的就只能靠看我们这个剥客"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:17,960",
				"to": "00:00:21,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 17960,
				"to": 21040
			},
			"text": "然后自己下功夫 自己感兴趣 认真选"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:21,760",
				"to": "00:00:24,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 21760,
				"to": 24760
			},
			"text": "光给钱没用 就跟我们岂刚才咱们恰到了 对吧"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:24,760",
				"to": "00:00:28,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 24760,
				"to": 28880
			},
			"text": "光给钱 种材票 又有什么用呢"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:28,880",
				"to": "00:00:31,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 28880,
				"to": 31440
			},
			"text": "那不就也是也归零嘛"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:31,700",
				"to": "00:00:32,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 31700,
				"to": 32460
			},
			"text": "對吧"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:34,520",
				"to": "00:00:37,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 34520,
				"to": 37840
			},
			"text": "這個抖音最近就是那個什麼紅國短劇我看"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:38,100",
				"to": "00:00:41,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 38100,
				"to": 41680
			},
			"text": "而且我就是看那個太太上面有一些遊戲也挺有意思"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:41,940",
				"to": "00:00:43,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 41940,
				"to": 43220
			},
			"text": "我就大家就可以玩一下"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:43,720",
				"to": "00:00:50,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 43720,
				"to": 50120
			},
			"text": "那個有個遊戲那個短劇就是說什麼你突然中了五百萬什麼中了三千萬之後你的人生會發生變化"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:50,900",
				"to": "00:00:53,980"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 50900,
				"to": 53980
			},
			"text": "如果大家缺錢的人可以先玩一下這個遊戲"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:55,500",
				"to": "00:00:57,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 55500,
				"to": 57800
			},
			"text": "中了三千萬後我的人生會怎麼樣"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:58,060",
				"to": "00:01:00,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 58060,
				"to": 60580
			},
			"text": "如果你玩的那个游戏最后玩的到破产啊"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:01,300",
				"to": "00:01:02,420"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 61300,
				"to": 62420
			},
			"text": "那说明政治不够"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:03,220",
				"to": "00:01:03,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 63220,
				"to": 63700
			},
			"text": "对"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:05,900",
				"to": "00:01:08,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 65900,
				"to": 68820
			},
			"text": "你的任志根本没达到能掌控三千万的地步"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:09,940",
				"to": "00:01:11,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 69940,
				"to": 71700
			},
			"text": "那是先提升任志不要想去挣钱"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:11,700",
				"to": "00:01:14,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 71700,
				"to": 74700
			},
			"text": "因为挣钱甚至你就算发狠材对你是催命服"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:15,740",
				"to": "00:01:17,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 75740,
				"to": 77060
			},
			"text": "对真是这个道理"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:17,060",
				"to": "00:01:20,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 77060,
				"to": 80100
			},
			"text": "对吧不是我们并不是说大家旁边不配用我这个财富"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:20,460",
				"to": "00:01:21,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 80460,
				"to": 81460
			},
			"text": "在带道理"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:21,460",
				"to": "00:01:22,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 81460,
				"to": 82660
			},
			"text": "真的是这个原理"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:22,660",
				"to": "00:01:23,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 82660,
				"to": 83780
			},
			"text": "把讲白了这个原理"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:23,780",
				"to": "00:01:25,860"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 83780,
				"to": 85860
			},
			"text": "不是我们说是好像踩骑士上的人"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:26,260",
				"to": "00:01:29,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 86260,
				"to": 89360
			},
			"text": "他這個原理 你給他玩一下的遊戲試試"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:29,360",
				"to": "00:01:33,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 89360,
				"to": 93600
			},
			"text": "就這個玩如果我今天中了三天晚那個遊戲"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:33,600",
				"to": "00:01:36,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 93600,
				"to": 96400
			},
			"text": "你玩了之後我考後面的破產的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:36,400",
				"to": "00:01:41,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 96400,
				"to": 101440
			},
			"text": "那你真的要想一下我考我現實生活中的三天晚可能也這個結局"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:41,440",
				"to": "00:01:45,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 101440,
				"to": 105000
			},
			"text": "對吧 那就講到這個任職問題"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:45,000",
				"to": "00:01:49,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 105000,
				"to": 109480
			},
			"text": "就前往講了 先自由後財富"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:51,080",
				"to": "00:01:53,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 111080,
				"to": 113960
			},
			"text": "对,那就是财富"
		}
	]
}
